<title>POLAND: Two Polish firms to enter bourse later this week.</title>
<headline>Two Polish firms to enter bourse later this week.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader  Centrostal SA will start bourse trade on Wednesday and construction company  Elektromontaz Warszawa SA on Thursday, a bourse official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Centrostal and Elektromontaz Warszawa will be listed on the exchange's parallel market.</p>
<p>&quot;The bourse decided on Friday that Centrostal would debut on March 19 and Elektromontaz Warszawa on March 20,&quot; Adam Maciejewski, the head of bourse sessions department told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
